# Quiz content data
# The app lets users pick an arbitrary folder on disk (via the File System
# Access API) at runtime for their quiz content — videos, questions, team
# names, etc. That folder lives outside this repo entirely and must never
# be committed here. This entry is a safety net in case anyone ever points
# a local quiz data folder inside the project tree by mistake.
/quiz-data/
/quiz-content/
/QuizNightData/
